Skyrim 1.7.x is an Anniversary Edition runtime. The pinned CommonLib classifies
the running game by its minor version and only 1.6 counted as AE, so 1.7.104
fell through to SE and the library loader looked for version-1-7-104-0.bin in
format 1 (Skyrim Platform: "ID.h(215): failed to open address library file",
seen on the lab client 2026-09-30). thuum branch skyrim-1.7, ADR-018.

--- a/include/REL/Module.h
+++ b/include/REL/Module.h
@@ -169,6 +169,7 @@
 						_instance._runtime = Runtime::VR;
 						break;
 					case 6:
+					case 7:  // the 1.7.x releases are Anniversary Edition builds (versionlib-*.bin, format 5)
 						_instance._runtime = Runtime::AE;
 						break;
 					default:
@@ -340,6 +341,7 @@
 						_runtime = Runtime::VR;
 						break;
 					case 6:
+					case 7:  // the 1.7.x releases are Anniversary Edition builds (versionlib-*.bin, format 5)
 						_runtime = Runtime::AE;
 						break;
 					default:
